    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tns-research/covering-array-records/zipball/v1.10",
    "body": "Adds three parameter sets and improves eight of our own entries, 11 parameter sets in all at strengths 3 to 5. The largest gains: CA(291; 3, 32, 5) and CA(884; 3, 58, 7) (our previous 323 and 929, previous best 324 and 930), from search programs written by Claude Opus (generators/v1.10/, no LLM at run time). The other nine come from post-optimisation (generators/postop.c, no LLM at run time) of our earlier entries or of record arrays of the ca-tools table from Bai XunDi (doi:10.5281/zenodo.23787055 and 10.5281/zenodo.23787053): CA(77835; 4, 31, 12), CA(36435; 4, 29, 10), CA(42436; 5, 21, 6), CA(30264; 5, 16, 6), CA(44155; 5, 23, 6), CA(224844; 5, 13, 10), and CA(559529; 4, 48, 20), CA(559570; 4, 48, 21), CA(559613; 4, 48, 22) (small gains). All 11 new files verified by ca_verify of ca-tools and by a second, independent checker, with a negative control. CA(126935; 4, 25, 14) is now overtaken by the table's derived CA(126929; 4, 25, 14), symbol fusion of our CA(126931; 4, 25, 15). Prior art checked on 2026-11-13 against ca-tools commit 69c708e, see README."
  },
