    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/tns-research/covering-array-records/zipball/v1.9",
    "body": "Adds five parameter sets and improves 41 of our own entries, 46 parameter sets in all at strengths 3 to 6. The largest gains: CA(6871; 4, 38, 6) and CA(7195; 4, 39, 6) (previous best 7812 and 7902), from search programs written by Claude Opus (generators/v1.9/, no LLM at run time); CA(N; 4, k, 6) for k = 26 to 37, 5.4 % to 11.3 % below the previous best (for example CA(6335; 4, 33, 6), previous best 7145); CA(36615; 4, 29, 10) (41007). The other arrays come from post-optimisation (generators/postop.c, no LLM at run time) of record arrays of the ca-tools table, most from the deposit of Bai XunDi (doi:10.5281/zenodo.23787055), or of our earlier entries. All 46 new files verified by ca_verify of ca-tools and by a second, independent checker, with a negative control. CA(416; 3, 11, 6) of version 1.8 is now overtaken by CA(411; 3, 11, 6) of Kevin Grey. Prior art checked on 2026-11-11 against ca-tools commit 8a30577, see README."
  },
