    "body": "Adds 21 parameter sets, among them the first three at strength 6, and improves 28 of our own entries, 49 parameter sets in all at strengths 3 to 6. The largest gains: CA(3516; 4, 14, 6) and CA(3786; 4, 15, 6) (previous best 4080 and 4132), from the PGL(2, 5) family of version 1.7 with one fixed column; CA(6254; 4, k, 6) for k = 26 to 29 (previous best 6456 to 6851), from a program written by Claude Opus; CA(35983; 4, 28, 10) (39954). The other 43 come from post-optimisation (generators/postop.c, no LLM at run time) of record arrays of the ca-tools table, most from the deposit of Bai XunDi (doi:10.5281/zenodo.23787055), or of our earlier entries. All 50 new files verified by ca_verify of ca-tools and by a second, independent checker, with a negative control. Prior art checked on 2026-11-08 against ca-tools commit 84933d2, see README."
