    "body": "Adds 33 parameter sets and improves 13 of our own entries, 46 arrays in all, at strengths 3, 4 and 5. The largest gains are on CA(N; 4, k, 6): CA(6445; 4, 37, 6) (previous best 7199) and k = 28 to 39, and a family developed under PGL(2, 5) and a cyclic shift of the columns for k = 11, 12, 15, 16 and 21 to 25. The other 22 come from post-optimisation (generators/postop.c, no LLM at run time) of record arrays of the ca-tools table, most from the deposit of Bai XunDi (doi:10.5281/zenodo.23787055). All 46 verified by ca_verify of ca-tools and by a second, independent checker, with a negative control. Prior art checked on 2026-11-04 against ca-tools commit 1628e1b, see README."
